{"data": {"event": {"id": "9fa37f93-f270-4761-a40f-fc726b37bffb", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/2121/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Tumor mimics en neuroradiologie : quand ce n'est pas tumoral", "start": "2026-10-08T16:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-08T17:30+02:00", "objectives": ["<div>Identifier les diagnostics diff\u00e9rentiels non tumoraux \u00e0 une l\u00e9sion nodulaire c\u00e9r\u00e9brale<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>", "<div>Reconna\u00eetre les caract\u00e9ristiques IRM d'une l\u00e9sion n\u00e9crotique non tumorale (abc\u00e8s, radion\u00e9crose, s\u00e9quelle vasculaire)<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>", "<div>Savoir distinguer une anomalie de signal en plage non tumorale (l\u00e9sion inflammatoire, enc\u00e9phalite, gliose r\u00e9actionnelle)<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>", "<div>Discuter les pi\u00e8ges diagnostiques mimant un m\u00e9ningiome (l\u00e9sions secondaires, sarco\u00efdose, lymphome\u2026)<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>", "<div>L'imagerie multimodale (perfusion, diffusion, spectroscopie) en aide au diagnostic pour les cas classiques et les pi\u00e8ges \u00e0 \u00e9viter<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "3694ce47-7cad-4040-9699-c461d58e73da", "name": "Salle Passy", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "ea160e75-b256-4625-b044-daab391f2407", "title": "Quand \u00e7a ressemble \u00e0 un nodule", "start": "2026-10-08T16:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-08T16:42+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "685df4b8-5818-4e16-8990-3ad2769151bf", "lastName": "Jaillard", "firstName": "Alienor", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/w